Help Desk Lab 6: Slow Computer Troubleshooting
Ticket ID: LAB-006
Category: Windows Performance / Troubleshooting
Environment: Simulated Windows 11 help desk lab
Status: Resolved in the initial scenario
Lab Type: Simulated training exercise

1. Issue Description
The user reported that their computer was running slowly, applications were taking longer than usual to open, and the computer occasionally froze for a few seconds.

2. Initial Assessment
Asked the user when the issue began and whether it affected one application or multiple applications.

Reviewed the simulated Task Manager readings:

Resource

Usage

CPU

24%

Memory

88%

